  "body": "The message is clear ! This Property MUST BE SOLD and ALL OFFERS WELCOME! \r\nThe vendors are highly motivated and have made another significant price reduction! Now offered WELL BELOW CV, this is an exceptional opportunity for buyers looking for outstanding value in Macleans School Zone.\r\nPositioned on a flat 650sqm freehold section, this beautifully renovated five bedrooms family home offers generous living spaces, quality upgrades and an unbeatable location, all within walking distance of Pigeon Mountain Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College.\r\nPROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS\r\n•Flat 650sqm freehold section with fully fenced backyard\r\n•Five spacious bedrooms, three bathrooms and two separate living areas\r\n•Electric gated entrance providing privacy and security\r\n•Beautifully landscaped, easy care gardens with fruit trees\r\n•Modern kitchen with premium appliances and custom cabinetry\r\n•Extensive upgrades to bathrooms, plumbing, electrical systems and interior finishes\r\n•HRV ventilation, Daikin air conditioning, CCTV, intercom and smart security features\r\n•Double internal access garage with carpeted flooring\r\nSPACIOUS & FLEXIBLE FAMILY LIVING\r\nGround Floor:\r\n•Light filled open plan living and separate dining area\r\n•Stylish modern kitchen with quality appliances\r\n•Seamless flow to a covered deck and sunroom, perfect for year round entertaining and BBQs\r\n•Three generous bedrooms and two bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n•Extensive custom built storage and cabinetry\r\nUpper Floor:\r\n•Spacious second lounge, ideal for teenagers or extended family\r\n•Dedicated study area with custom double workstation\r\n•Two generous bedrooms and a modern family bathroom with underfloor heating\r\n•Flexible spaces perfect for growing families, guests or working from home\r\n\r\nThe vendors' circumstances have changed, and selling is now their priority. No more waiting and they want action! Don't miss this opportunity. View it, love it and make your offer today!",
